MODULE: CrashDropsFence
TARGET: FenceCoversUnread
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: activation forgets the persisted fence before replay has passed its head
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ crashes' = crashes + 1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<established, wal, fenceWal, value, ckpt, fence,
--- REPLACE
    /\ crashes' = crashes + 1 /\ fence' = 0
    /\ UNCHANGED <<established, wal, fenceWal, value, ckpt,
--- END
